-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

From the file's header: "Based on the public domain implementation in crypto_hash/keccakc512/simple/ from
http://bench.cr.yp.to/supercop.html by Ronny Van Keer and the public domain "TweetFips202" implementation from
https://twitter.com/tweetfips202 by Gilles Van Assche, Daniel J. Bernstein, and Peter Schwabe".

