3. Algorithms (attribution)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - lazer/aes256ctr.c: the bitsliced AES S-box implements the Boyar–Peralta S-box circuit (J. Boyar, R. Peralta;
    113 gates per the source comment).
  - src/pqz_mpn.h: C99 re-implementations, under pqz_mpn_* names, of the GMP mpn calls LaZer makes; GMP itself is
    not used.

pqz-core links no GMP, MPFR, Intel HEXL, libstdc++ or compiler-rt (glic/runs/absence-*.txt).
